content.text:
Note: the keydown handler — when image selected and user presses Escape while focus is in .doc-page (caret in text), the first branch checks `!e.target.closest('.doc-page')` — if focus is inside page, Escape won't deselect and falls to no branch, so existing handler closes the doc page. Acceptable.

Now CSS additions. Append to styles.css: doc-img-bar, doc-img-selected, redact styles, editor-hint-inline. Check .editor-hint exists; add .editor-hint-inline maybe not needed — I used span.editor-hint-inline; add styling or drop. Add CSS:

```
.editor-hint-inline{font-size:11px;color:#7b8599}
.doc-page img.doc-img-selected{outline:2px dashed #5676e8;outline-offset:2px}
.doc-img-bar{...}
body[data-theme="dark"] .doc-img-bar{background:#252c3f;border-color:#3a4258}
.redact-layer{position:absolute;inset:0}
.redact-box{...}
...
```

Where to append — end of styles.css. But media queries are inline in file; appending at end fine. Check dark theme variable usage (body[data-theme="dark"]).

Then run node --check and start testing.

input.command:
cat >> styles.css <<'CSS'
/* Penyisipan gambar di Pembuat PDF */
.doc-page img.doc-img-selected{outline:2px dashed #5676e8;outline-offset:2px}
.doc-img-bar{position:fixed;z-index:60;display:flex;gap:4px;padding:5px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e7eaf1;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(45,58,90,.18)}
.doc-img-bar button{border:1px solid #e7eaf1;background:#fafbfe;color:#4a5a78;border-radius:7px;padding:5px 9px;font:600 11px 'DM Sans',sans-serif;cursor:pointer}
.doc-img-bar button:hover{background:#eef1fb;color:#536fd5}
.doc-img-bar button[data-imgact="remove"]:hover{background:#fdf1ef;border-color:#f2cfc8;color:#c25343}
body[data-theme="dark"] .doc-img-bar{background:#252c3f;border-color:#3a4258}
body[data-theme="dark"] .doc-img-bar button{background:#2d3449;border-color:#3a4258;color:#c9d2e6}
body[data-theme="dark"] .doc-page img.doc-img-selected{outline-color:#8fa5ff}
/* Editor Redact PDF */
.editor-hint-inline{font-size:11px;color:#7b8599}
body[data-theme="dark"] .editor-hint-inline{color:#9da8bd}
.redact-layer{position:absolute;inset:0}
.redact-box{position:absolute;background:rgba(0,0,0,.3);border:1.5px dashed #d47993;cursor:grab;touch-action:none;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none}
.redact-box:active{cursor:grabbing}
.redact-box.selected{background:rgba(0,0,0,.45);border-style:solid;border-color:#d47993}
.redact-box-resize{position:absolute;right:-8px;bottom:-8px;width:15px;height:15px;border-radius:4px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #d47993;cursor:nwse-resize;touch-action:none}
.redact-preview{position:absolute;background:rgba(0,0,0,.3);border:1.5px dashed #d47993;pointer-events:none}
body[data-theme="dark"] .redact-box{border-color:#e89ab0}
body[data-theme="dark"] .redact-box.selected{border-color:#e89ab0}
body[data-theme="dark"] .redact-preview{border-color:#e89ab0}
body[data-theme="dark"] .redact-box-resize{border-color:#e89ab0}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.redact-box,.doc-img-bar button{transition:none!important}}
CSS
node --check app.js && echo SYNTAX-OK

