Requires Docker and Node 24.

```sh
git clone --recursive https://github.com/mssio/qpdf-wasm.git
cd qpdf-wasm
npm ci
npm run build:wasm   # compiles qpdf in the pinned emscripten/emsdk image (~1 min)
npm test
npm run build
